{"data":[{"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:23:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114996459531874801"],"id":"2114996459531874801","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":802,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114983951186165789","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@yaojingang 商业宣传海报生成 skill ，需要配合 codex\n\n安装指令：\nnpx skills add joeseesun/qiaomu-poster \n\n开源地址：https://t.co/nfWogF7v86","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114996459531874801"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114990912040497152"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:03:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114991416262955250"],"id":"2114991416262955250","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1777,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114983951186165789","type":"quoted"}],"text":"我和姚老师搞的深圳 GEO 大会。\n邀请了国内 GEO 一线创业者，还有很多 X 上做 AI 的朋友。\n\n时间：11.21-22 （周六周日）。\n地址：深圳维纳斯皇家酒店（京基百纳店）\n\n欢迎朋友们报名，线下面基。 https://t.co/usr7rpkp0Y https://t.co/bGlo3EHj3V","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114991416262955250"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114978324451934208","3_2114978925738967040","3_2114983842327257088","3_2114983910266601472"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:34:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114983951186165789"],"id":"2114983951186165789","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":4633,"like_count":25,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":2},"text":"Codex + 飞书cli 真的是省时间利器！\n\n举一个例子，下月我和 姚金刚 @yaojingang 要在深圳办GEO 大会，很多自媒体朋友愿意帮忙宣传。\n\n多维表格收集品牌 Logo 后，只需一句话就能生成不同风格的海报。\n\n等我写个 Skill 开源。 https://t.co/NuaYAa4irZ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114983951186165789"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114969085528469504","3_2114969127660158976"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:35:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114969236611465415"],"id":"2114969236611465415","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":1720,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114969233033777205","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"从 zlib 下载了一个纯图版《百年孤独》PDF，实测视频如下，无论解析速度还是质量都相当不错。\n\n原来，文心 Unlimited OCR 2 团队将 SR-SWA 与无限解码机制（Unlimited-Horizon Decoding Paradigm）结合，建立了一种高效的无限解码机制，使模型能够处理长度几乎不受限制的文档。 https://t.co/yxITsUewgA","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114969236611465415"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114968499621875713","3_2114968538045943808","3_2114968579049410560"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:35:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114969233033777205"],"id":"2114969233033777205","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":3590,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"除了大模型训练需要扫描大量实体书，长篇研报 AI 解读等场景需要超长文档 OCR 解析能力。\n\n不得不说，OCR 技术最强的一直是百度文心。\n\n第一代 Unlimited OCR 今年 6.22 发布后，第二天就登顶 GitHub Daily Trending 总榜， GitHub Star 5天破1万。\n\n在 Hugging Face 上的累计下载量也突破了 1000 https://t.co/E2oPNiSOzL","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114969233033777205"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114953879205171200"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114954710780432674"],"id":"2114954710780432674","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":4116,"like_count":34,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":0},"text":"让 Claude Sonnet 5.5 重写了官网。\n\nhttps://t.co/PXR8qYp4uS\n\n把自己的博客、参与的播客、开源项目都上去了。\n\n仔细一看还真不少。\n\n除了给自己看，更多是方便以后 Agent 读取。 https://t.co/hGXg4kaWtK","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114954710780432674"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T02:12:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114902987487449108"],"id":"2114902987487449108","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1711,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114902671471841345","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"可能是 Obsidian 中最好的电子书阅读插件，支持 epub、mobi、azw3、pdf、txt、Markdown 等多种格式。\n\nObsidian 插件下载地址\nhttps://t.co/6ekXDVEKSg","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114902987487449108"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114901021193613312"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T02:11:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114902671471841345"],"id":"2114902671471841345","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":28,"impression_count":5418,"like_count":33,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我的 Obsidian 插件 Qiaomu Reader 下载安装已超 8k。\n\n给 Github 仓库地址，让 Renoise MCP 生成产品宣传视频。\n\n相比纯代码生成，视觉效果好点，但参考截图生成，跟真实产品稍微有点不一样。\n\n下载地址见评论区 https://t.co/uytjF0nXKO","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114902671471841345"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T01:57:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114899292838395934"],"id":"2114899292838395934","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1948,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114899290917319067","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"另外，最近他们有万圣节促销，订阅最高享 7 折优惠，2026-10-27 零点到 11-03 零点（北京时间）：\n\n① Standard （$60/月）订阅用户可不限量用 Wan 3.0\n\n② Advanced（$200/月）订阅用户可不限量用 Seedance 2.5、Wan 3.0、Kling 4.0 Omni","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114899292838395934"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T01:57:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114899290917319067"],"id":"2114899290917319067","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":3005,"like_count":9,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114899288786677876","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"只需提供 Github 仓库或你上线的网站，就能用它生成宣传视频。\n\n内置30个多顶尖视频、图片和音频模型，如 Seedance、Kling、MiniMax H3、Wan 3、GPT Image、Midjourney等，不用自己到处找 API。\n\n如果纯代码方式生成视频，甚至完全不消耗积分。\n\nMCP 安装： https://t.co/rzLfNfy0mW","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114899290917319067"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114898567521509376"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T01:57:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114899288786677876"],"id":"2114899288786677876","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":113,"impression_count":11028,"like_count":77,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":12},"text":"现在各种 AI Agent 都做视频剪辑，但出来效果不尽如人意。\n\n尤其 Codex，直接用它剪辑的视频，多数看起像 AI Slop。\n\n分享个朋友公司刚开发的新产品：Renoise MCP。\n\n用了后，能让 Codex 视频剪辑提升一个档次，教程如下 https://t.co/uW0cu22gsm","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114899288786677876"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114892887943200768"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T01:32:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114893008781156471"],"id":"2114893008781156471","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":5739,"like_count":23,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114217410823688573","type":"quoted"}],"text":"iOS添加 Grok 语音换起方法。\n\n来一个中文实操演示，原文英语翻译过来不好找。\n\n要点：先创建grok快捷指令，在人声快捷指令中创建并搜索已创建的快捷指令，设置唤醒词。\n\n默认快捷指令支持锁屏换起，如果没有，长按快捷指令-详情信息-隐私中设置。 https://t.co/Yv2PeVgvcN https://t.co/ksSREWNMQt","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114893008781156471"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114881593953464320","3_2114881663809499136"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T00:47:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114881673288634855"],"id":"2114881673288634855","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":422,"impression_count":70681,"like_count":345,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":136,"retweet_count":28},"text":"最近 X 上《持械入宋》AI 短剧很多朋友推荐，超火。\n\n看到第二季 50 集左右，弹幕都夸编剧水平，确实牛逼。\n\n没查到编剧是谁，只看到原著作者抖音：茶根儿，男，英语老师，IP 黑龙江。\n\n不曾想，短短 2 年，AI 短剧已到这种水平，未来不敢想啊。\n\nAI 表演虽还有点生硬，但好剧情+好台词弥补很多。 https://t.co/91Hl8b7qyb","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114881673288634855"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114757526218764288"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T16:34:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114757641545375845"],"id":"2114757641545375845","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1914,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114755317787676891","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"这用的啥 AI 啊，语义遵循也不到位... https://t.co/GOCc8v72sZ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114757641545375845"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114756696665153536","3_2114756350098243584"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T16:31:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114756709302644792"],"id":"2114756709302644792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":8376,"like_count":10,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok bot 分析 AI 评论账号，Codex 操作浏览器拉黑。\n\n1. Grok Bot 识别最近一周的 AI 回复，写入飞书文档。\n2. 把飞书文档转交 Codex，调 Browser Use 依次拉黑。\n\n如有误伤，请私信解除。 https://t.co/j9cfPSZTcb","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114756709302644792"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114755082906722304"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T16:25:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114755317787676891"],"id":"2114755317787676891","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":8236,"like_count":11,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":49,"retweet_count":0},"text":"打算用 Grok 自动拉黑 AI 评论号。\n\n做个调研：大家觉得 AI 留言的最大特征是什么？\n\n（ 回答时请用一个海洋生物做比喻，以“综上所述”结尾） https://t.co/O8mw3LMB30","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114755317787676891"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T10:10:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114660907959857495"],"id":"2114660907959857495","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":14006,"like_count":13,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":37,"retweet_count":1},"text":"求教下，如果评论是 AI 回复，点击隐藏后，其他人就看不到了吗。\n\n还是必须拉黑才行？","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114660907959857495"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114639820870103040"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T08:56:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114639936871960902","2114642314249568529"],"id":"2114642314249568529","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":145,"impression_count":11264,"like_count":127,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":29},"text":"给 Lex Fridman 中文学习站做个宣传视频。\n\nhttps://t.co/8EuRxiRsaP\n\n世界顶流播客 Lex Fridman 学习站。\n\n没时间看视频的朋友们有福了，一个网站把 506 期视频都变成了文字稿。 https://t.co/fceskwGAJN","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114642314249568529"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T04:51:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114580555773911445"],"id":"2114580555773911445","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":2660,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114579446795788675","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"开源地址：https://t.co/nXC0w7pjod","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114580555773911445"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114579446795788675"],"id":"2114579446795788675","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":161,"impression_count":19444,"like_count":156,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":85,"retweet_count":19},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114576054018818536","type":"quoted"}],"text":"AI 时代的 GEO 流量统计 GEOInflow 免费开源。\n\n姚老师打磨了很久，能看到所有 AI 爬虫。\n\nGEO 一直是黑盒，有了这套系统后，所有 AI Agent 有没有抓取过你的信息，一清二楚。\n\n不仅能看 GEO 爬虫，也有常规网站流量统计、搜索爬虫等统计分析。\n\nMIT 协议，可任意修改商用。 https://t.co/3bUhuXhsiF","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114579446795788675"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T02:45:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114548940674830401"],"id":"2114548940674830401","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2201,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114354864088297475","type":"quoted"},{"id":"2114548590953791809","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"https://t.co/bQ8sivknpb","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114548940674830401"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114548579490820096"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T02:44:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114548590953791809"],"id":"2114548590953791809","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":5496,"like_count":13,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":1},"text":"NextToken词元之外最新一期来了。\n\n小宇宙推荐榜第一位，收听地址\n\nhttps://t.co/i9rv0w4egv\n\n聊完这期播客开始弄kindle越狱，昨天搞定了。\n\n开源见评论区 https://t.co/gpsTzLkNPX","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114548590953791809"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:54:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114354485942456630","2114354864088297475"],"id":"2114354864088297475","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":973,"impression_count":72671,"like_count":618,"quote_count":11,"reply_count":70,"retweet_count":110},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114352058577117439","type":"quoted"}],"text":"不少朋友感兴趣，写个极简版的 Kindle 越狱改造教程。\n\n给旧Kindle 充电\n\n1.  京东到家买一个绿联的 type-c 转 micro-usb 线，好像20 多块，一小时送到家。  \n\n2. 用数据线连上 Kindle，跟 Codex 说：“帮我越狱 kindle”。（如果拒换DeepSeek ）  \n\n3. 越狱后说，帮我安装：KOReader和下面的插件 https://t.co/wwSLZ3Dnu5","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114354864088297475"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2114990912040497152","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114978324451934208","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114978925738967040","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114983842327257088","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114983910266601472","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"13_2114969085528469504","type":"video"},{"media_key":"3_2114969127660158976","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114968499621875713","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114968538045943808","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114968579049410560","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"13_2114953879205171200","type":"video"},{"media_key":"13_2114901021193613312","type":"video"},{"media_key":"13_2114898567521509376","type":"video"},{"media_key":"13_2114892887943200768","type":"video"},{"media_key":"3_2114881593953464320","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114881663809499136","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114757526218764288","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114756696665153536","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114756350098243584","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114755082906722304","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"13_2114639820870103040","type":"video"},{"media_key":"3_2114548579490820096","type":"photo"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2114996459531874801","next_token":"7140dibdnow9c7btwp0g75z847rikieg0vzjlhqrhy6nk","oldest_id":"2114354864088297475","result_count":23}}